      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "Perhaps my only reservation about being stationed in The Dust is the elders' insistence on transferring us regularly between outposts. It's to stop Greenguards becoming attached to prisoners, they say, although the chances of some of my peers developing any kind of emotional bond is next to zero."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "おそらく、私がザ・ダストに駐在することについて唯一の予約は、長老が前置所間で定期的に私たちを移すという主張です。 グリーンガードが囚人に付随するのを防ぐためだと、彼らは言います。しかし、私の仲間の中には、感情的な結びつきを発展させる可能性はゼロに隣り合わせです。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "The journey between outposts is stressful, particularly with the Drysap working its magic. But this is the price I must pay to follow my dreams."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "特にドライサップが魔法を解き明かすのが特徴です。 しかし、これは私が私の夢に従うために支払わなければならない価格です。"
    }
